464 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 210 0 R
/T (Conceptual Narrative: If a producer has limited labor and technology, and they are making a choice between two goods, the experience a downward-sloping, curved PPC. This is because as they want more of a good the opportunity cost \(expressed in terms of the other good\) is increasing, causing an increase slope on our line. )
/E (Conceptual Narrative: If a producer has limited labor and technology, and they are making a choice between two goods, the experience a downward-sloping, curved PPC. This is because as they want more of a good the opportunity cost \(expressed in terms of the other good\) is increasing, causing an increase slope on our line. )
/Pg 34 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
